sentences.text:
By way of this application under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (hereinafter referred to as "the Code"), the applicant has prayed for quashing and setting aside FIR being C.R.No.11191012220704 of 2022 registered with Dani-limda Police Station, Dist. Ahmedabad City,
for the offence under Sections 363, 376(2)(N) of the Indian Penal Code and under Sections 3(A), 4,
5(L), 6, 11(6), 12 of the POCSO Act as well as other consequential proceedings arising therefrom.

